  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Welcome Home**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **It Makes No Difference**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2012-07-28** (recommended): source not stated; 12 songs; 72 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Laura Veirs and Ben Sollee joined the band on some songs, marked with an asterisk in the notes [1]\n- Brittany Howard and Clint Maedgen guested on other songs; Conor Oberst and Ben Sollee joined for another [1]\n- Bad weather forced the set to end early [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2012-07-28**: source: NPR Broadcast [1]",
